      "cooked": "<p>In frappe hr roster, when I push + to add a shift assignation, in pop up, in shift type field, I only can select between the 20 results showed, but I have more than 50.</p>\n<p>If I type in search field, only search between that 20 results. Here some images:</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/4/54d49a10b8ff75e4ebdabbe177b0a710698cab52.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/54d49a10b8ff75e4ebdabbe177b0a710698cab52\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/4/54d49a10b8ff75e4ebdabbe177b0a710698cab52_2_690x353.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"c6rBuTtBn7RPpVTgWTRXe8DY8aS\" width=\"690\" height=\"353\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/4/54d49a10b8ff75e4ebdabbe177b0a710698cab52_2_690x353.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/4/54d49a10b8ff75e4ebdabbe177b0a710698cab52_2_1035x529.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/4/54d49a10b8ff75e4ebdabbe177b0a710698cab52.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"E6E7E6\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1166×598 41.3 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>As you can see, Im searching for shift type UCO T1, and does not display it, but in the back of the roster, you can see it assigned to another employee.</p>\n<p>Does anyone have this issue? Thanks!</p>",
